#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Global Settings"
msgstr "Globalne postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first setting here is <guilabel>Enable Plugins globally</guilabel>. If "
"you disable this check box, then &konqueror; will not use any plugins. If "
"you enable it, then any installed and configured plugins that it can find "
"will be used by &konqueror;"
msgstr ""
"Prva postavka ovdje je <guilabel>Omogući globalne priključke</guilabel>. Ako "
"onemogućice ovaj kvadratić, onda &konqueror;  neće koristiti nikakve "
"priključke. Ako omogućite, svi instalirani i konfigurisani priključci će "
"biti korišteni od strane &konquerora;a"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also restrict &konqueror; to <guilabel>Only allow HTTP and HTTPS "
"URLs for plugins</guilabel> by checking the box."
msgstr ""
"Možete također ograničiti &konqueror; na  <guilabel>Dozvoli samo HTTP i "
"HTTPS URLs za priključke</guilabel> označavajući ovaj kvadratić."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "The next option determines, if plugins are loaded on demand only."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća opcija određuje da li će priključci biti učitani ili samo po "
"naredbi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the slider labeled <guilabel>CPU priority for plugins</guilabel> to "
"adjust this setting."
msgstr ""
"Koristite klizač pod nazivom <guilabel>CPU pripritet za priključke</"
"guilabel> da podesite ove postavke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click the <guibutton>Domain-Specific Settings</guibutton> button to open a "
"dialog where you can set specific plugin policies for any particular host or "
"domain. These policies will be used instead of the default policy for "
"enabling or disabling plugins on pages sent by these domains or hosts."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Postavke za određenu domenu</guibutton>  da "
"otvorite okvir u kom možete podesiti određena pravila priključaka za bilo "
"koji određeni host ili domenu. Ova pravila će biti korištena umjesto zadanih "
"pravila za omogućavanje i onemogućavanje priključaka poslanih od strane ovih "
"domena ili hostova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add a new policy here or select a policy and use the controls on the right "
"to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte novo pravilo ovdje ili odaberite pravilo koje će se koristiti i "
"koristiti desne kontrole da ih podesite."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:81 index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Plugins</title>"
msgstr "<title>Dodaci</title>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As &Netscape;'s <application>Navigator</application> has been a web browsing "
"standard for many years, so-called &Netscape; plugins have appeared that "
"allow rich web content. Using those plugins, web sites can contain "
"<acronym>PDF</acronym> files, flash animations, video, &etc; With "
"&konqueror;, you can still use these plugins to take advantage of rich web "
"content."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&Netscape; plugins should not be confused with &konqueror; plugins. The "
"latter ones specifically extend &konqueror;'s functionality; they are "
"normally not used to display rich web content."
msgstr ""
"&Netscape; priključci ne bi trebali biti miješani sa &konqueror; "
"priključcima. Drugi su specijalne ekstenzije za &konqueror;ove "
"funkcionalnosti; oni nisu normalno korišteni da se prikazuje bogati veb "
"sadržaj."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scan for Plugins"
msgstr "Traži priključke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&konqueror; has to know where your &Netscape; plugins are installed. This "
"can be in several places, &ie; you might have system-wide plugins in "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/opt/netscape/plugins</filename> and your "
"personal plugins in <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>HOME</envar>/."
"netscape/plugins</filename>. However, &konqueror; will not automatically use "
"the installed plugins: it first has to scan a list of folders. You can "
"initiate the scan by clicking <guibutton>Scan for Plugins</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To find plugins, &konqueror; will look in the folders specified in the "
"<guilabel>Folders</guilabel> frame. When you use this control module for the "
"first time, this list will already be filled with reasonable paths that "
"should work on most operating systems. If you need to provide a new path, "
"click the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button; then you can either enter the "
"new path in the text edit box to the left, or choose a folder using the file "
"dialog by clicking the <guibutton>Open file</guibutton> icon. As scanning "
"the folders can take a little time, you might want to remove folders from "
"the list where you know that no plugins are installed: do this by selecting "
"a folder and clicking <guibutton>Remove</guibutton>. Using the "
"<guibutton>Up</guibutton> and <guibutton>Down</guibutton> buttons you can "
"change the order in which folders will be scanned by moving the selected "
"folder up or down."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As usual, click <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> to save your changes "
"permanently."
msgstr ""
"Kao i obično, kliknite na <guibutton>Primijeni</guibutton> da trajno "
"sačuvate promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this section, you can see a list of the &Netscape; plugins found by "
"&konqueror;, displayed as a tree. Double click on a plugin to fold it out "
"and you will see that the different mime types this plugin can handle will "
"be displayed as branches. Fold out a mime type to see its info."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "This list is only for informational purposes."
msgstr "Ova lista je samo za informativne svrhe."
